          "title": { "ja": "初勝利をつかめ", "en": "Grab the First Win" },
          "story": {
            "before": { "ja": "今日は勝ちにいく。スタートを決めて、直線で一閃。", "en": "Today you race to win. Nail the start, then strike in the straight." },
            "after": { "ja": "初めての勝利。相棒が鼻を鳴らした。騎手の道は、ここから始まる。", "en": "Your first win. Your partner snorts. The jockey's road starts here." }
          },
          "clear": { "maxPlace": 1 },
